    <td>J00</td><td>S — Synthetic intercurrent illness at an unscheduled visit; chosen because infection is a common trigger of cyclic vomiting and because cold medicines interact with amitriptyline. It does not echo a documented illness.</td>
  </tr></tbody></table></text>

